{"code":"352910","name":"오비고","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"소프트웨어","sector_desc":"패키지·보안·플랫폼 소프트웨어. 반복 매출 비중과 성장률이 밸류에이션을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 2003년 설립된 모빌리티 라이프 AX 플랫폼 기업으로, 2021년 코스닥에 상장하였음. AI 콘텐츠, AI 카케어, 피지컬 AI 솔루션을 중심으로 사업하고 있으며, 글로벌 OEM에 IVI 플랫폼, AI 콘텐츠 플랫폼 '픽시리즈' 등을 공급하고 있음. 독보적인 브라우저 엔진 기술로 모빌리티 넘어서 전력, 로봇, 스마트 팩토리 등 다양한 산업의 AI 전환을 주도하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":4395.0,"open":4280.0,"high":4745.0,"low":4280.0,"volume":1267,"amount":5568465.0,"ret_1d":0.2281,"gap":-2.3945,"range_pct":10.5802,"ret_5":-5.0756,"ret_20":-11.5694,"ret_60":18.7838,"ret_120":-17.0755,"ret_250":4.5184,"ma20":4710.5,"ma60":4253.1667,"ma120":4445.5833,"ma200":4729.175,"close_vs_ma200":-7.0662,"close_vs_ma60":3.3348,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":488.6739,"r2_60":0.6216,"slope_120":-28.1266,"r2_120":0.0728,"slope_250":-9.3073,"r2_250":0.0301,"high52":7300.0,"low52":3115.0,"pos_52w":30.5854,"dd_52w":-39.7945,"mdd_1y":-49.6947,"atr14_pct":8.7112,"vol_ann_60":52.078,"vol_avg20":6849.3,"vol_ratio20":0.185,"vr5":0.3671,"vr20":0.1759,"amount_avg5":23770306.0,"amount_avg20":32412951.5,"amount_avg60":54963434.6667,"obv_chg20":-42.8701,"turnover_20":1.0839,"pv_eff_20":-10.6735,"rsi14":38.6074,"frgn_net_5":1061.0,"inst_net_5":697.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0084,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0055,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0139,"frgn_net_20":-8649.0,"inst_net_20":10187.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0684,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0806,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0122,"frgn_net_60":-1084.0,"inst_net_60":-1956.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0086,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0155,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0241,"frgn_net_120":-28257.0,"inst_net_120":15999.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.2236,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1266,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.097,"foreign_ratio":0.7,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.06,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-11.0,"op_margin_q":-10.0,"op_qoq":26.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":26.6667,"rev_yoy":34.1463,"op_trend_4q":-15.1111,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-2.55,"debt_ratio":78.63,"per":null,"pbr":1.63,"div_yield":